#: ../../geovista/docs/src/developer/packaging.rst:240
msgid ""
"A ``pixi`` :term:`environment <Environment>` is defined by combining one or "
"more :term:`features <Feature>`. For further details see this ``pixi`` "
"`tutorial`_ on how to create and use features in a multi-environment "
"scenario."
msgstr ""
"``pixi`` の :term:`環境 <Environment>` は、1 つ以上の :term:`フィーチャー <Feature>` "
"を組み合わせることで定義されます。詳細は、マルチ環境シナリオでフィーチャーを作成・使用する方法に関する ``pixi`` の `tutorial`_ "
"を参照してください。"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/developer/packaging.rst:244
msgid ""
"Our features are defined under the :toml:`[tool.pixi.feature]` tables in the"
" :bash:`pyproject.toml` manifest."
msgstr ""
"フィーチャーは :bash:`pyproject.toml` マニフェスト内の :toml:`[tool.pixi.feature]` "
"テーブルで定義されています。"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/developer/packaging.rst:247
msgid ""
"Each named `feature table`_ e.g., :toml:`[tool.pixi.feature.devs]`, may "
"contain various fields, such as :toml:`dependencies`, :toml:`pypi-"
"dependencies`, :toml:`pypi-options`, :toml:`system-requirements`, "
":toml:`activation`, :toml:`platforms`, :toml:`channels`, :toml:`channel-"
"priority`, :toml:`target` and :toml:`tasks`."
msgstr ""
"名前付きの各 `feature table`_ (例: :toml:`[tool.pixi.feature.devs]`) "
"には、:toml:`dependencies`、:toml:`pypi-dependencies`、:toml:`pypi-"
"options`、:toml:`system-"
"requirements`、:toml:`activation`、:toml:`platforms`、:toml:`channels`、:toml:`channel-"
"priority`、:toml:`target`、:toml:`tasks` などのさまざまなフィールドを含めることができます。"

